## 🐶 Archie (Dog Companion)

* Based on the developer’s real dog
* Small terrier mix
* Brown-and-white coat
* Friendly, happy, floppy ears

**Gameplay Role:**

* Appears periodically in-game
* Clicking Archie grants a small timed bonus

**Art Rules:**

* Must match existing Archie pixel icons exactly in style
* Expressions: playful, cheerful, cozy — never aggressive or realistic

