## 💬 Community & Tone Guidelines

* Maintain a positive, constructive community space
* Hostile or bad-faith behavior is not tolerated
* Transparency is encouraged in devlogs and patch notes
* Cozy, friendly, sincere tone in all communication

Donations support real-world needs (e.g., Archie’s medical care) and should be framed with honesty and gratitude.

---

## 🧭 Design North Star

If a decision is unclear, default to:

> **Does this make the game cozier, clearer, and more rewarding over time — without adding stress?**

If yes, it belongs.

